# Portfolio (Rithvik)

Astro 5 + TypeScript + vanilla JS. Designer-owned; prefer direct code iteration.

## Brand

- Navy `#15173D`, purple `#982598`, pink `#E491C9`, cream `#F1E9E9`, yellow `#E8C96B`
- Fonts: Erode (serif display), Recia (body) — CSS vars `--font-serif` / `--font-sans`
- Avoid generic AI looks (purple-on-white, cream+terracotta, broadsheet)

## Key paths

- Hero: `src/pages/index.astro`, styles in `src/styles/global.css`
- Thought overlay: `ThoughtProcess.astro`, `src/lib/thoughtProcess.ts`, `thoughtLine.ts`
- Projects: `src/data/projects.ts`, `src/pages/projects/[slug].astro`
- Shell: `Header.astro`, `PageLayout.astro`, `BaseLayout.astro`

## Hero intent (open)

- Name: **Hi! I’m Rithvik** — cream interactive **dot under the R** opens thought process
- Sketch CTA **how I think** with hand-drawn arrow tip aimed at the cream mark
- Dot should sit tight under R (not under “it”); sketch should feel attached, not floating
- Header logo is **dot only** (no name text)

## Run

```bash
npm run dev
```

Default: http://localhost:4321

## Notes

- Git `main` may have **no commits yet** (all files untracked)
- Remove leftover debug `agent log` / ingest `fetch` instrumentation in `index.astro` if still present
